    "아이와 함께 1단계부터 차근차근. 각 단계는 '설명해 주기 → 물어보기 → 함께 해보기' 순서로 10분이면 충분해요." : {
      "comment" : "EducationView.swift:158",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Go step by step from Step 1 with your child. Each step takes about 10 minutes: explain, ask, then try it together."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Go step by step from Step 1 with your child. Each step takes about 10 minutes: explain, ask, then try it together."
